#: app/templates/inventario/reservas.html:55
msgid "¿Cómo funciona?"
msgstr "How does it work?"

#: app/templates/inventario/reservas.html:56
msgid ""
"El lote de cada pedido se decide al preparar la proforma (o al crear el "
"pedido, si lo crea Yikon) y queda reservado: ningún otro pedido puede "
"llevárselo y al enviar salen exactamente esos lotes. La reserva se suelta"
" sola al enviar o al cancelar el pedido. Si un cliente no contesta una "
"proforma, libérala aquí para que ese stock vuelva a estar libre."
msgstr ""
"The lot for each order is decided when preparing the proforma (or when "
"creating the order, if Yikon creates it) and stays reserved: no other "
"order can take it and exactly those lots are shipped. The reservation is "
"released automatically on shipping or when the order is cancelled. If a "
"customer does not answer a proforma, release it here so that stock is "
"free again."

